  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya &amp; Uganda Annual Partners Meeting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Kenya &amp; Uganda Core Programme (One Programme) recently developed and adopted a new Kenya &amp; Uganda (KU) Programme Strategy titled Resilience Livelihoods Programme (2023 &#x2013; 2030), underpinned by CAFOD&#x2019;s Global Strategy &#x2013; Our Common Home: 2020 - 2030. The Our Common Home is based on the Pope&#x2019;s Encyclical Laudato Si, which encases CAFOD vision and values and delineates the links between the cry of the poor and the cry of the earth, and how they intertwine and how CAFOD&#x2019;s priority is to respond to both in an integrated way.</narrative>
  </description>
